stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> assigned: CEO creates task
    assigned --> accepted: Agent accepts
    accepted --> in_progress: Work begins
    in_progress --> in_progress: Progress notes added
    in_progress --> blocked: Blocker found
    blocked --> in_progress: Blocker resolved
    in_progress --> completed_unverified: Agent marks done
    completed_unverified --> completed: CEO verifies
    completed_unverified --> in_progress: Verification failed
    completed --> [*]
    in_progress --> failed: Unrecoverable error
    failed --> [*]
